  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-journal-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-journal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-journal-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo_Forge-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=231C25&amp;color=3d215c\"></a>\n</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Loot Journal 是一款客戶端模組，為物品拾取提供流暢動畫通知、智能堆疊與完整的視覺自訂功能。即時追蹤自己與附近玩家的拾取情況，在遊戲內調整每個細節，享受乾淨、沉浸的使用體驗。</h2><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Rn2RuE.png\"></p><p><br></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u0aVYsI.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">流暢拾取顯示</h1>\n        <p>乾淨、動畫化的拾取通知會從畫面邊緣自然滑入，無縫融入遊戲過程。智能堆疊、合併與定位邏輯保持資訊清晰易讀，特殊效果則凸顯稀有物品。完整支援物品與經驗值。</p>\n    </div>\n</div><p><br>\n</p><hr><br><p></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">視覺主題</h1>\n        <p>從多種內建視覺主題中選擇，每種主題都有獨特風格與佈局。每個主題均可單獨調整，並可透過資源包添加全新主題，實現完全的視覺自由。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1613/690/lj1-jpg.jpg\" width=\"60%\">\n</div><p><br>\n</p><hr><br><p></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iup6WPg.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">玩家追蹤</h1>\n        <p>即時查看附近玩家拾取了哪些物品。跟蹤好友動態、發現稀有戰利品，或監控周圍活動。完全可配置玩家過濾器——玩家也可以透過隱形效果或雕刻南瓜保持隱藏。在原版伺服器上也能運作！</p>\n    </div>\n</div><p><br>\n</p><hr><br><p></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">遊戲內設定</h1>\n        <p>一套完全可存取且使用者友善的設定系統，讓您微調模組的各個面向。直接在遊戲內調整佈局、位置、動畫、音效與過濾，並立即獲得反饋。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1612/362/4-jpg.jpg\" width=\"60%\">\n</div><p><br>\n</p><hr><br><p></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1612/363/5-jpg.jpg\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">精緻的使用體驗細節</h1>\n        <p>專為清晰與舒適而設計。條目更新時會脈動顯示，大量拾取爆發會被整潔地匯總，並追蹤物品總數——包括儲物箱、袋子及其他容器內部的物品。所有功能協同運作，讓畫面資訊豐富而不雜亂。</p>\n    </div>\n</div><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ZBaOT4.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AWVa1rL.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0F3Uyq.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillager-caravans\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lPK6BrB.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elixirum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zMZKr3b.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjJSLI0.png\" width=\"45%\">\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4lV9g9R.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Y7y8mO.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p>",
